---
title: "HR to Entra ID"
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<div class="layout">
  {% include "partials/sidebar.njk" %}
  <main class="content">
    <div class="home">
      <p class="content__eyebrow">HR to Entra ID</p>
      <h1>Govern Microsoft 365 from HR, with no on-premises directory</h1>
      <p class="home__intro">A hire in Contoso People is imported into Saviynt. Saviynt’s Entra ID connector then creates the cloud account over Microsoft Graph — a <strong>connected application</strong>, not a task list and not Active Directory. Same people as the hybrid series; different target.</p>

      <div class="home__grid">
        {% for lab in collections.labs %}
        <a class="labcard" href="{{ lab.url | url }}">
          <span class="labcard__order">{{ lab.data.order | pad2 }}</span>
          <h2 class="labcard__title">{{ lab.data.title | labShortTitle }}</h2>
          <p class="labcard__meta">
            <span class="pill">⏱ {{ lab.data.estimated_time }}</span>
            <span class="pill pill--{{ lab.data.difficulty | lower }}">📶 {{ lab.data.difficulty }}</span>
          </p>
          <p class="labcard__tags">{{ lab.data.tags | join(" · ") }}</p>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
